next release.. But this is a rush job..

What this archive contains:
~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
Check2.............The actual "C" upload checking Pfile.
Check2.docs........Hmm maybe something useful.
Check2.cfg.........Config file. Place in same dir as Check2.
Append.............DOS program that appends one file to another.
Sys.validation.....Example of my Sys.Validation.
7 Conv???..........Some scripts for converting archives. Or just
                   adding text to  Zip, Zoo, Arc, and Lzh/Lha. files.


Introduction.
~~~~~~~~~~~~~

Well here it is folks, the long awaited "C" Upload checking utility. 
This is a beta version and still has much work needed to be done to it. 
This program will check the following archive types:

DMS, Warp, Zoom, Zoo, Zip, Arc, Zoo, Lzh, Lha.

It will also add/append ASCII/ANSI text to any file uploaded.
With the exceptions of zoom, arj, and future sit support.
It can also convert or just add text to Zip, zoo, and arc
files. You will still have to adopt orphans to put them online.
This will be one of my next goals is automatic adoption
of the new archive, and deleting of the old.


The major improvment this version provides over earlier versions
is SPEED... No longer does the upload checking utilitly need to read
or write to the upload log. All information on newly uploaded
files is extracted right from memory. This will also make things
safer for bbs's running multi-lines.
  

